


NUMBER(6)           UNIX Programmer's Manual            NUMBER(6)



NAME
     number - convert Arabic numerals to English

SYNOPSIS
     /usr/games/number

DESCRIPTION
     _N_u_m_b_e_r copies the standard input to the standard output,
     changing each decimal number to a fully spelled out version.
     Punctuation is added to make the output sound well when
     played through _s_p_e_a_k(1).

SEE ALSO
     speak(1)









































